[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479615085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112293#issuecomment-3479615085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112293","id":3479615085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PZrZt","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T09:27:11Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T09:27:11Z","body":"> Code make sense to me, but the device initialization process warrants a refactor to fix #98207 anyway, which would also naturally handle your issue. It's better if we can avoid the D3D12 runtime validating the adapter twice.\r\n\r\nIt appears that some functionalities can only be verified after the device is created. The solutions are either to move the actual logic of device initialization to `RenderingContextDriverD3D12` for verification, or to add minimal device initialization code in `RenderingContextDriverD3D12` for validation purposes.\r\n\r\nSo, should I close this PR and wait for the refactoring, or can we merge this PR first and then proceed with the refactoring?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","re